                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "Most teams I've worked with discover the value of a design system the hard way — after shipping three slightly different versions of the same button, or when a brand refresh requires updating 200 screens individually.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "cornerRadius": 2,
                  "id": "Wn9M2",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1096,
                  "name": "Quote Bar",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "width": 4,
                  "height": 96
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K3lUi",
                  "x": 140,
                  "y": 1096,
                  "name": "Pull Quote",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 680,
                  "content": "\"Consistency is not about being boring. It's about freeing your team to focus on the problems that actually matter.\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mBg6B",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1232,
                  "name": "Para 2 H",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "The anatomy of a good system",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "soSAl",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1268,
                  "name": "Para 2 Body",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "A design system isn't just a Figma file with components. It's a shared language — an agreement between design and engineering about how the product looks, feels, and behaves. The best systems I've seen have three things in common: they're documented, they're maintained, and they're genuinely used.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CH67u",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1440,
                  "name": "List Num 1",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "1",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qoXFZ",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1444,
                  "name": "List Title 1",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "Tokens before components",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jER1z",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1470,
                  "name": "List Body 1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 660,
                  "content": "Start with color, spacing, and type scales as design tokens. Everything else builds on these foundations.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rPoru",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1570,
                  "name": "List Num 2",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "2",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zu6zv",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1574,
                  "name": "List Title 2",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "Document in context",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vfuCr",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1600,
                  "name": "List Body 2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 660,
                  "content": "Don't write docs separately — embed them in the system itself. Storybook and Figma annotations both work.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WBRPr",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1700,
                  "name": "List Num 3",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "content": "3",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nP6Dq",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1704,
                  "name": "List Title 3",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "Treat it as a product",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zTIAB",
                  "x": 160,
                  "y": 1730,
                  "name": "List Body 3",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 660,
                  "content": "The system needs an owner, a roadmap, and versioning. Abandon that and it becomes a graveyard.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r14GJ",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1860,
                  "name": "Para 3 H",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "content": "Getting buy-in from engineering",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UoO0R",
                  "x": 120,
                  "y": 1900,
                  "name": "Para 3 Body",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 720,
                  "content": "The hardest part isn't building the system — it's getting the team to actually use it. I've found the fastest path is to solve a real, painful problem that already exists. Fix the inconsistent spacing issue that's been annoying the front-end team for months. Ship that. Then build from there.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-main",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "cornerRadius": 12,
                  "id": "wMScO",
                  "x": 1040,
                  "y": 876,
                  "name": "Sidebar Bg",
                  "fill": "$bg-elevated",
                  "width": 280,
                  "height": 380,
                  "stroke": {
                    "align": "inside",
                    "thickness": 1,
                    "fill": "$border"
                  }
                },
